<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Android Studio on Winner's Dev Notes</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/tags/android-studio/</link><description>Recent content in Android Studio on Winner's Dev Notes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 16 May 2024 23:28:55 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://releaseleaf.com/tags/android-studio/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Facebook Android Key Hash: Convert Signing SHA-1 to Base64</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/faankehaco.html</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 May 2024 23:28:55 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/faankehaco.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The usual command produced an unexpected 24-character value instead of the required key hash:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;keytool -exportcert -alias YOUR_ALIAS -keystore YOUR_KEYSTORE &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; openssl sha1 -binary &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; openssl base64&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;img src="https://pic.imgdb.cn/item/664626b7d9c307b7e9060e0c.png" alt="Unexpected result"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;An alternative is to print the signing certificate details:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;keytool -list -v -keystore key.jks -alias key0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Copy the SHA-1 fingerprint:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://pic.imgdb.cn/item/6646283ad9c307b7e9091a4c.png" alt="SHA-1 fingerprint"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Remove separators, convert the hexadecimal bytes to Base64 with a trusted local tool, and register the result in the Facebook developer console.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Fix Android Entry Name classes.dex Collided by Cleaning Build Outputs</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/fianennacl.html</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Apr 2024 20:38:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/fianennacl.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;An Android Studio release build failed with:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Entry name &amp;#39;classes.dex&amp;#39; collided&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;img src="https://pic.imgdb.cn/item/662a68b60ea9cb14030fd7e0.png" alt="Build error"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Open the Build menu and select &lt;code&gt;Clean Project&lt;/code&gt;. After cleanup finishes, build the release package again.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://pic.imgdb.cn/item/662a68b70ea9cb14030fd825.png" alt="Clean Project"&gt;</description></item><item><title>Fix Android Studio Build Type Isn't Debuggable by Selecting a Debug Variant</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/fianstbuty.html</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 Feb 2024 22:11:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/fianstbuty.html</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="why-android-studio-cannot-attach-the-debugger"&gt;Why Android Studio Cannot Attach the Debugger&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#why-android-studio-cannot-attach-the-debugger"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The message &lt;code&gt;build type isn't debuggable&lt;/code&gt; usually means the selected module is using a non-debuggable &lt;code&gt;release&lt;/code&gt; variant.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="select-the-debug-build-variant"&gt;Select the Debug Build Variant&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#select-the-debug-build-variant"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open the &lt;code&gt;Build Variants&lt;/code&gt; tool window, locate the module, and change its active variant from &lt;code&gt;release&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;debug&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://s11.ax1x.com/2024/02/22/pFNIFXV.png" alt="Build Variants"&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>